      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Midtown_Sacramento",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Sutter's Fort, the first European settlement in California, sits in Midtown and marks the birthplace of Sacramento’s statehood era.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Midtown_Sacramento",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Center for Sacramento History preserves over 15 million feet of 16‑mm news film, including KCRA and KOVR footage from 1957‑1982.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
