      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.centerforsacramentohistory.org/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Neon signs from the Center’s collection now light up the Golden 1 Center plaza, a partnership that began when the Kings sought historic displays for the new arena.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
